    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\n\n- [X] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\n- [X] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\n\n### Module(s)\n\nmini.bufremove\n\n### Description\n\nHi, it would be nice to be able to add autocomands on the bufremove created buffers.\r\nAs for now, when I try to add some functions in an empty filetype, it has an impact on other parts of neovim, so it would really nice to explicitly set a pattern on this file.\r\n\r\nThank you!",
